> basis a { lu(x, y, z) = lut }
> basis b : a { inv(x) = ~x }
> basis a : b { andp(x, y) = x & y }
> maj(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = a & b | a & c | b & c
> gates maj basis a
gates for maj: 3 input bits -> 1 output bit, basis a
  minimal: cost 1, 1 step (no program of cost <= 0 exists; 1 candidates searched)
  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 8 care inputs
  t0 = lu(a, b, c, 0xe8)            = (~c & b & a) | (c & ~b & a) | (c & b & ~a) | (c & b & a)
  r0 = t0
